# EnLang NLP Sentiment & Feedback Engine (.enlg)

display("=== EnLang Culinary NLP Review Analysis ===")

set review1 to "The Truffle Wagyu Steak was an awesome, fantastic and superb culinary experience!"
analyze sentiment of review1 and store in s1
extract keywords from review1 into kw1

display("Customer Review 1: " + review1)
display("NLP Sentiment Result: " + s1)
display("Extracted Keywords: " + kw1)

set review2 to "The service was slow and the soup was terrible and awful."
analyze sentiment of review2 and store in s2
extract keywords from review2 into kw2

display("Customer Review 2: " + review2)
display("NLP Sentiment Result: " + s2)
display("Extracted Keywords: " + kw2)
